  | **DECISION:** I must: (1) Apply JNDI mitigation to the Log4j JVM, (2) Kill/block the JDWP debug port, and (3) Apply firewall rules. Since I can't easily restart the JVM with new flags, I'll focus on network-level hardening and JVM property injection.

